  "changelog": [
    "Restored the validated 11-row v2 Codex atlas so native Codex task states and look directions load correctly.",
    "Reworked sleep into a single enter-breathe-wake timeline and made play slower with smooth ping-pong frame order.",
    "Translated all pet metadata and care actions to English.",
    "Care actions are slower and now complete a guaranteed number of full animation loops.",
    "Published Biruzik in the pet catalog.",
    "Added sleep, eat, wash, play, and toilet care actions.",
    "Added short autonomous play sessions while wandering.",
    "Added a separate care atlas while preserving the standard Codex resource format."
  ],
